       }
      ],
      "text": "Qsymia peds:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " indicated in adults and peds ≥ 12 y w obesity; after 12 wk on 7.5/46 mg, peds w BMI ↓ < 3%: 11.25/69 mg × 14 d, then 15/92 mg; stop if BMI ↓ < 5% after 12 wk on 15/92 mg; wt loss > 2 lbs (0.9 kg)/wk: consider a lower dose; slowed linear growth: consider a lower dose or stopping."
     }
    ]
   },
